<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When we’re together our joy is made so full;</l><l>The love of the Lord fills our hearts,</l><l>And we all partake of the Spirit bountiful.</l><l>We’ve found, here in the family life, a part.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here we will stay, Lord, according to Your plan,</l><l>For here in the church life we’re one;</l><l>And we will be built up to be the corp’rate man</l><l>To consummate the New Jerusalem.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
